WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.399
Apple Watch can

00:00:01.211 --> 00:00:02.283
now summarize your

00:00:02.095 --> 00:00:03.156
conversations

00:00:03.678 --> 00:00:05.777
The watchOS 27.3

00:00:05.588 --> 00:00:06.767
beta adds Siri

00:00:06.579 --> 00:00:07.227
Recap

00:00:07.322 --> 00:00:08.312
which lets Series

00:00:08.124 --> 00:00:09.527
12 and Ultra

00:00:09.338 --> 00:00:10.553
4 Apple Watches

00:00:10.364 --> 00:00:11.838
listen to conversations

00:00:11.662 --> 00:00:12.958
and summarize them

00:00:13.097 --> 00:00:14.571
Audio is discarded

00:00:14.383 --> 00:00:15.644
after each summary

00:00:16.174 --> 00:00:17.247
After two weeks

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:17.801
of testing

00:00:18.025 --> 00:00:19.735
MacRumors found summaries

00:00:19.547 --> 00:00:20.678
too brief with

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:21.869
no speaker labels

00:00:21.728 --> 00:00:22.624
and no audio

00:00:22.436 --> 00:00:23.190
to check

00:00:23.329 --> 00:00:24.567
Long talks like

00:00:24.379 --> 00:00:25.239
vet visits

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:26.371
got merged into

00:00:26.183 --> 00:00:27.539
confusing recaps

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:29.402
It even summarized

00:00:29.214 --> 00:00:30.322
YouTube videos

00:00:30.461 --> 00:00:31.675
Siri Recap is

00:00:31.487 --> 00:00:32.442
still in beta

00:00:32.254 --> 00:00:32.890
and is due

00:00:32.702 --> 00:00:34.682
with watchOS 27.3

00:00:34.494 --> 00:00:35.319
in December

00:00:35.862 --> 00:00:36.876
Full story on

00:00:36.687 --> 00:00:37.583
the dashboard
